{
 "comment": "Up Your Arsenal's routes for port/tools/regress: one tour of each single-player level, entered by --level N with OPENRAC_DIRECT (rac3-pal host/program.c), walking, turning the camera, jumping, the wrench, firing, the pause pages, the quick select. The multiplayer maps (40 to 55) are not routes yet: the port does not load them. Each run stops with a crash report on a wait that never ends (OPENRAC_STUCK), and carries on past memory that is not mapped, counted (OPENRAC_SOFT_FAULTS). The hero's words are not mapped for rac3, so a route only presses (no teleports, items or health writes: addresses is empty). Scripted runs want frame_rate = original in their settings (regress.py run takes --setting).",
